---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { email } from "../data.js";
---

<Base title="Privacy" lines={["Privacy"]} dek="What artifisi.com collects about you, which is almost nothing." description="What artifisi.com collects about you, which is almost nothing.">
  <section class="sys read"><div class="row"><p class="word">Last updated 30 October 2026</p><div class="body">
  <p>This site has no accounts and no analytics. We don't set cookies.</p>
  <p>
    The contact form sends your name, email and message through Formspree, which delivers it to our inbox. We
    use it only to reply.
  </p>
  <p>
    Our host, Cloudflare, keeps normal server logs: IP address, browser, which page. We only use them to keep
    the site running.
  </p>
  <p>
    The Dunia demo plays from Google Drive and loads when you scroll to it. Game trailers play from YouTube
    (privacy-enhanced mode) and only load when you press play. Google may set its own cookies when either loads.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you email us or use the form, we keep the message so we can reply, and we don't share it. Ask at
    <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a> and we'll delete it.
  </p>
  </div></div></section>
</Base>
